o, so a retried POST stops charging twice", "comments": 0, "category": "Show and tell", "created_at": "2026-08-09T16:24:38Z"}, {"number": 1956, "title": "MCP Tools For Elysia", "comments": 0, "category": "Ideas", "created_at": "2026-08-07T05:04:32Z"}, {"number": 1929, "title": "How to set global parse to application/json?", "comments": 1, "category": "Q&A", "created_at": "2026-06-29T12:17:11Z"}, {"number": 1918, "title": "Elysia derive / macro middleware composition breaks Eden typing (media: any)", "comments": 1, "category": "Q&A", "created_at": "2026-06-12T10:28:29Z"}, {"number": 1915, "title": "How to create proxy Handler like nginx proxy?", "comments": 2, "category": "Q&A", "created_at": "2026-06-09T03:57:19Z"}, {"number": 1910, "title": "How is onAfterResponse supposed to know if the onError event was triggered?", "comments": 2, "category": "Q&A", "created_at": "2026-06-05T03:18:05Z"}, {"number": 1813, "title": "[Proposal] Official CLI tool for ElysiaJS", "comments": 0, "category": "Ideas", "created_at": "2026-03-20T14:15:28Z"}], "readme": "<p align=center>\n <img src=https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8168188b-ffaf-444f-8d09-c516ce140824 alt=\"Elysia Banner\" />\n</p>\n\n<h3 align=center>Elysia</h3>\n<p align=center>Ergonomic Framework for Humans</p>\n\n<p align=center>\n    <a href=https://elysiajs.com>Documentation</a> | <a href=https://discord.gg/eaFJ2KDJck>Discord</a> | <a href=https://github.com/sponsors/SaltyAom>Sponsors</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n\n<p align=center>TypeScript with End-to-End Type Safety, type integrity, and exceptional developer experience. Supercharged by Bun.</p>\n\n<br>\n\n![Elysia chan cover | bun creeate elysia app](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a649731a-8cba-4ca2-8424-6656cbf84956)\n\n<!---\n```bash\nbun create elysia app\n```\n\n![Elysia feature sheet including 18x faster than Express based on Techempower benchmark, Frontend RPC Connector, Advance TypeScript type, unified type single source of truth of type TypeScript